        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:07.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Clinicians lose nearly 28 hours each week to paperwork and administrative tasks, fueling burnout and straining budgets.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/infrastructure-and-cloud/google-cloud/gemini-for-healthcare/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T17:44:07.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini for healthcare reasons across this context to orchestrate and execute complex, multi-step workflows — such as medical records synthesis and prior authorization review — within defined guardrails and with appropriate human oversight.",
